        "original_id": "484c1d99-e56e-5231-9133-06d3667190dd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: U2\n- Events: U2 360° Tour, Lungs Tour\n- Places: Barcelona\n- Concepts: live performance, in-the-round staging, tour support\n\nFacts:\n- U2 did not perform \"Electrical Storm\" live until 2 July 2009, when the band played it at the second concert of the U2 360° Tour in Barcelona.\n- The U2 360° Tour was a worldwide concert tour by the rock band U2.\n- The U2 360° Tour featured in-the-round concerts on a circular stage that allowed audiences to surround U2 on all sides.\n- In 2011, acts associated with the Lungs Tour also supported U2 on the U2 360° Tour.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
